<section class="vo-club-panel" id="voClubPanel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="voClubTitle" tabindex="-1" hidden>
    <div class="vo-club-sheet"><header><div><span class="vo-eyebrow">THE RIVAGE CLUB</span><h2 id="voClubTitle">Play. Taste. Unwind.</h2></div><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voCloseClub" aria-label="Tutup klub">✕</button></header>
        <nav class="vo-club-tabs" aria-label="Fasilitas klub"><button type="button" data-vo-club="play">Permainan</button><button type="button" data-vo-club="dine">Bar & restoran</button><button type="button" data-vo-club="music">Musik</button></nav>
        <p id="voClubStatus" class="vo-club-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Saldo dan menu dimuat saat restoran dibuka.</p>
        <div id="voClubPlay" class="vo-club-section">
            <div class="vo-club-fields"><label>Permainan<select id="voPlayableGame" aria-label="Pilih permainan"></select></label><label>Lawan / teman<select id="voPlayPartner"><option value="">Komputer · latihan sendiri</option></select></label><button type="button" class="vo-primary" id="voStartGame">Mulai / ajak</button></div>
            <div class="vo-game-invitation" id="voGameInvitation" hidden><b id="voGameInviteText"></b><button type="button" class="vo-primary" id="voAcceptGame">Terima</button><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voDeclineGame">Tolak</button><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voEndGame">Akhiri</button></div>
            <p id="voGameInstructions">Pilih permainan lalu Mulai. Badminton, tenis, tenis meja, dan foosball mendukung duel giliran langsung dengan rekan online. Lawan offline dimainkan komputer.</p>
            <div class="vo-play-surface"><canvas id="voGameCanvas" width="800" height="480" tabindex="0" aria-label="Arena permainan interaktif. Kontrol juga tersedia melalui tombol dan penggeser di bawah."></canvas><b id="voGameScore" role="status">Pilih permainan Anda</b></div>
            <div class="vo-club-fields vo-play-controls"><label id="voRacketField">Posisi raket<input id="voGameRacket" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Arah / bidikan<input id="voGameAim" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Kekuatan<input id="voGamePower" type="range" min="1" max="100" value="60"></label><button type="button" class="vo-primary" id="voGameAction">Pukul / tembak</button><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voGameReset">Ulang latihan</button></div>
            <div id="voGameCards" class="vo-game-cards" aria-label="Kartu di tangan / pilihan langkah"></div><p id="voGameStatus" role="status"></p>
        </div>
        <div id="voClubDine" class="vo-club-section" hidden><div id="voPortableHeading" hidden><span class="vo-eyebrow">TAKE A MOMENT</span><h3>Bekal untuk perjalanan Anda.</h3><p>Berjalan ke tempat pilihan, lalu nikmati pesanan yang sudah dibeli. Pembelian menu baru tersedia di bar.</p></div>
            <div class="vo-bar-hero" id="voBarHero" data-venue="bar"><div class="vo-bar-hero-copy"><span>THE RIVAGE COLLECTION / WATERFRONT</span><h3 id="voBarVenueName">Maison du Rivage.</h3><p>Marmer, cahaya keemasan, hidangan istimewa.<br>Sebuah tempat untuk menikmati malam dengan tenang.</p><div class="vo-venue-switch"><button type="button" data-vo-venue="bar" aria-pressed="true">Salon & bar</button><button type="button" data-vo-venue="disco" aria-pressed="false">✦ Éclipse · diskotik</button></div></div><div class="vo-bar-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><i class="vo-bar-arch"></i><i class="vo-bar-chandelier"></i><i class="vo-bar-counter-art"></i><i class="vo-bar-glass-art"></i><i class="vo-bar-stool-art"></i><span>MAISON<br>DU RIVAGE</span></div></div>
            <div class="vo-bar-concierge"><div><b>Éclipse Social Club</b><small>DJ booth · lantai dansa · sofa privat · lampu ambient</small></div><button type="button" class="vo-button" data-vo-venue="disco">🪩 Menuju lantai dansa</button><button type="button" class="vo-button" data-vo-club="music">♫ Pilih musik</button><label><input type="checkbox" id="voVenueEffects" checked> Efek lampu lembut</label></div>
            <div class="vo-dine-heading"><div><span class="vo-eyebrow">LA CARTE</span><h3>Hidangan untuk setiap suasana.</h3><p>Prancis & Nusantara · 44 pilihan · minuman tanpa alkohol</p></div><div><small>SALDO VIRTUAL</small><b id="voDineBalance">$ —</b><button type="button" class="vo-text-button" id="voRefreshWallet">↻ Perbarui saldo</button></div></div>
            <div class="vo-club-fields"><label>Tempat menikmati<select id="voRelaxPlace"><option value="bar">Maison du Rivage · bar</option><option value="disco">Éclipse · lantai dansa</option><option value="beach">Pantai & kursi santai</option><option value="garden">Taman bunga</option><option value="terrace">Teras pegunungan</option><option value="lounge">Lounge kantor</option></select></label><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voGoRelax">Pergi ke tempat ini</button><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voBackOffice">Kembali ke kantor</button><label>Cari menu<input type="search" id="voMenuSearch" placeholder="Ayam pop, croissant, kopi…"></label><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voOnlyFavorites" aria-pressed="false">♡ Favorit saya</button></div>
            <div id="voMenuGroups" class="vo-club-tabs" aria-label="Kategori menu"></div><p class="vo-menu-result" id="voMenuResult"></p>
            <button type="button" class="vo-mobile-cart" id="voShowCart" aria-controls="voBarCartAside">Lihat keranjang · $0</button>
            <div class="vo-bar-order-layout"><div id="voFoodMenu" class="vo-food-menu"></div><aside class="vo-bar-cart" id="voBarCartAside" aria-label="Keranjang pesanan"><span class="vo-eyebrow">YOUR TABLE</span><h3>Pesanan Anda.</h3><small id="voBarCartCount">0 porsi</small><div id="voBarCart"></div><div class="vo-cart-total"><span>Total virtual</span><b id="voBarCartTotal">$0</b></div><button type="button" class="vo-primary" id="voBarCheckout" disabled>Bayar keranjang</button><button type="button" class="vo-text-button" id="voClearCart">Kosongkan keranjang</button><button type="button" class="vo-text-button" id="voBackToMenu">↑ Kembali ke menu</button><p id="voBarCartHint">Menambah menu belum memotong saldo.</p></aside></div>
            <h3>Pesanan saya</h3><p>Berjalan dahulu ke tempat pilihan, lalu tekan Nikmati untuk menggunakan satu porsi. Minuman atau piring terlihat pada avatar selama 15 menit.</p><div id="voMyOrders" class="vo-my-orders"></div>
            <details><summary>Dompet & 15 transaksi terbaru</summary><p id="voDailyBonus">Bonus $1.000 virtual sekali per hari kalender WIB saat login atau membuka klub. Tidak dapat dibeli, ditransfer, atau diuangkan.</p><div id="voWalletHistory"></div></details>
            <details><summary>Struk pesanan bar · 10 terbaru</summary><div id="voBarReceipts"></div></details>
        </div>
        <div id="voClubMusic" class="vo-club-section" hidden><div class="vo-music-art" aria-hidden="true">♫</div><h3>Your own soundtrack.</h3><p>Instrumental orisinal diputar di perangkat Anda. Pilih genre, atau putar berkas musik pribadi tanpa mengunggahnya.</p><div class="vo-club-fields"><label>Genre<select id="voMusicStyle"><option value="lofi">Lo-fi</option><option value="pop">Pop</option><option value="rock">Rock</option><option value="jazz">Jazz café</option><option value="acoustic">Acoustic</option><option value="tropical">Tropical</option></select></label><label>Volume<input type="range" id="voMusicVolume" min="0" max="100" value="25"></label><button type="button" class="vo-primary" id="voMusicPlay">▶ Putar</button><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voMusicStop">Ⅱ Jeda</button></div><label class="vo-local-audio">Musik dari perangkat <input type="file" id="voMusicFile" accept="audio/*"></label><p id="voMusicStatus" role="status">Musik mulai setelah Anda menekan Putar, dan dijeda saat halaman tidak aktif.</p></div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="voAvatarChat" class="vo-avatar-chat" hidden aria-label="Percakapan langsung dengan avatar"><header><div><small>PERCAKAPAN DI KAWASAN</small><b id="voAvatarChatTitle"></b></div><button type="button" class="vo-button" id="voCloseAvatarChat" aria-label="Tutup percakapan">✕</button></header><div id="voAvatarMessages" class="vo-avatar-messages" aria-live="polite"></div><form id="voAvatarChatForm"><label for="voAvatarChatInput" class="sr-only">Pesan untuk avatar terpilih</label><div><input id="voAvatarChatInput" maxlength="350" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ketik lalu kirim…" required><button type="submit" class="vo-primary" id="voAvatarChatSend">Kirim</button></div></form><small id="voAvatarChatStatus" role="status">Hanya Anda dan penerima yang mendapat pesan serta gelembungnya. Riwayat tersedia 7 hari.</small></section>
